{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2021-05-21 05:00:00', 'title': 'MATCH GROUP TEAMS UP WITH WHITE HOUSE TO PROMOTE COVID-19 VACCINES', 'text': 'DALLAS, MAY 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MATCH GROUP (NASDAQ: MTCH) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS TEAMED UP WITH THE WHITE HOUSE TO PROMOTE COVID-19 VACCINATIONS ACROSS ITS LEADING U.S. BRANDS INCLUDING TINDER, MATCH, OKCUPID, HINGE, PLENTY OF FISH, BLK AND CHISPA. CAMPAIGNS WILL INCLUDE INFORMATION ON WHERE TO FIND COVID-19 VACCINE SITES, VACCINATION BADGES FOR SINGLES TO DISPLAY ON THEIR PROFILES, AS WELL AS FREE "SUPER LIKES" AND OTHER BOOST-TYPE FEATURES FOR U.S. USERS WHO SAY THEY ARE VACCINATED.'}